      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "ArtistDeck Studio • reading this dashboard",
          "text": {
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "content": "**Inbound:** uploaded videos + temporary render inputs. **Output:** generated MP4s.\n\n**Top compute cards use the dashboard time range: choose Today for usage since midnight.** Daily charts below always show the last 14 days (24-hour UTC buckets).\n\nStorage is Google's latest **daily measurement**, not live inventory. Live objects and seven-day recovery copies are separated. CPU allocated is **vCPU-seconds** (capacity allocated), not CPU utilization or a money amount. Cloud Run metrics can lag a few minutes.\n\n**Storage reporting check — 17 Nov 2026:** Google’s native bucket observability page and these queries currently return no size samples. Do not read “No data” as an empty bucket. A one-off live inventory at about 11:15 CET found **134,376,779 bytes inbound (134.4 MB)** and **190,682,764 bytes output (190.7 MB)**; these reference values are not automatically refreshed."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 3,
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Inbound • latest live bytes (daily)",
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "timeSeriesFilter": {
                "filter": "metric.type=\"storage.googleapis.com/storage/v2/total_bytes\" AND resource.type=\"gcs_bucket\" AND resource.labels.bucket_name=\"adstudio-staging-1023633877337\" AND metric.labels.type=\"live-object\"",
                "aggregation": {
                  "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                  "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_NEXT_OLDER",
                  "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                }
              },
              "outputFullDuration": true,
              "unitOverride": "By"
            },
            "blankView": {}
          }
        }
      },
